From: Aliaksei Ivanou <aliaksei.ivanou@innowise.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 18:56:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add test case attempt reporter events

Add TestCaseAttemptInfo and TestCaseAttemptStats, the attemptCount, maxAttempts and isFlaky fields of TestCaseStats, and the testCaseAttemptStarting and testCaseAttemptEnded events. The events are non-pure virtuals with empty default bodies, so existing reporters and listeners keep compiling; MultiReporter forwards them to listeners, then reporters. Nothing emits them yet.

Tests: SelfTest 'Multireporter forwards attempt events to listeners, then reporters' and 'Attempt events and fields are optional for existing reporters' (tagged [approvals] so the approval baselines stay unchanged).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GunDRycct3rWzK5p7dpZxP
